<title>POLAND: Swarzedz soars on DM 200 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz soars on DM 200 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish furniture producer Swarzedz SA surged 9.7 percent to 8.45 zlotys with strong buying after price fixing after Wednesday's news it had signed a 200-million-mark contract, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;That's quite a large sum,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Under the deal Swarzedz will produce furniture worth 200 million marks until 2002 for Germany's International Moebelhandelskantor Gmbh &amp; Co KH (IMK), part of Schieder Group.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
